{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t中朝新鴨綠江大橋早上舉行開通儀式。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n新華社說，新鴨綠江大橋是兩國互聯互通重要設施，開通後將進一步促進兩國經貿交流和人員往來，增進兩國人民福祉。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：方潤南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:36.426229+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":78,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T02:07:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T11:38:05.337768+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:12.095781+00:00","content_hash":"ad71378452140ca2809489a3936d78ae841e7dd50000ed684bc71aca5feb0605","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}